### Works in IntelliJ HTTP client / VS Code "REST Client". These calls can be used with the HTTP client.
@base = http://localhost:8080/api

### ---------- NORMAL FLOW ----------
POST {{base}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomNumber":"205","roomType":"Deluxe","floor":2}

###
POST {{base}}/housekeepers
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Ravi Kumar","phone":"9876543210","email":"ravi@stayease.com"}

### 3-5: room DIRTY -> task auto-created and assigned (use the room id returned above)
POST {{base}}/rooms/13/dirty

### 6: start (task id from GET /tasks)
PUT {{base}}/tasks/1/start

### 7: complete
PUT {{base}}/tasks/1/complete

### 8-9: pass inspection -> room READY
POST {{base}}/inspections
Content-Type: application/json
X-Performed-By: Supervisor Priya

{"taskId":1,"supervisorName":"Supervisor Priya","result":"PASSED","remarks":"All good"}

### 11-12: booking succeeds
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"guestName":"Arun","roomId":13,"checkIn":"2026-10-01","checkOut":"2026-10-03"}

### ---------- INVALID CASES (each must return a clear error) ----------
### Book a DIRTY / CLEANING room -> 409 ROOM_NOT_READY (mark a room dirty first, then book it)
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"guestName":"Test","roomId":1,"checkIn":"2026-10-01","checkOut":"2026-10-02"}

### DIRTY -> READY directly -> 409 INVALID_STATUS_TRANSITION
PUT {{base}}/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomNumber":"101","roomType":"Single","floor":1,"status":"READY"}

### Inspect before cleaning is complete -> 409 INVALID_STATUS_TRANSITION
POST {{base}}/inspections
Content-Type: application/json

{"taskId":2,"supervisorName":"Priya","result":"PASSED"}

### Failed inspection without remarks -> 400 BAD_REQUEST
POST {{base}}/inspections
Content-Type: application/json

{"taskId":2,"supervisorName":"Priya","result":"FAILED"}

### No housekeeper available (set all OFF_DUTY first) -> 409 HOUSEKEEPER_UNAVAILABLE
POST {{base}}/rooms/2/dirty

### Invalid input -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{base}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomNumber":"","roomType":"","floor":-1}

### Non-existing room -> 404 RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND
GET {{base}}/rooms/9999

### Pagination + sorting
GET {{base}}/tasks?page=0&size=5&sort=assignedAt,desc

### Reports
GET {{base}}/reports/housekeeper-workload
###
GET {{base}}/reports/turnaround-time
###
GET {{base}}/dashboard/summary
